The inspector general in Jefferson Parish outlined several flaws in a lease negotiation process for West Jefferson Medical Center that he said resulted in wasteful spending.
Inspector general David McClintock released a third report Wednesday on his office's concerns and recommendations regarding the lease agreement. The report comes less than a year after management of West Jefferson Medical Center was transferred to LCMC Health.
