No documentation or minutes taken of lease negotiation meetings that were held in executive session
An effort to exclude West Jefferson Medical Center from the negotiating process altogether
A contentious relationship between the two agencies hired to do the legal and financial consulting for the lease, including profanity-laced email exchanges
Billing for the consultants that exceeded the contract limits
